# Multi-Environment Architecture Plan

We will create a structured standard for modern web development using Docker on CasaOS/WSL.

## Architecture Structure

We will use a single `docker-compose.yml` to spin up 3 distinct environments: Development, Testing, and Production.

1. **Development (`dev`)**: 
   - Runs on port `5002`
   - Maps your local project folder into the container (`volumes: ./src:/app`) so that any code change immediately restarts the server without rebuilding.
   - Recommended URL: `dev.evaitec.com.tr`

2. **Testing/Staging (`test`)**:
   - Runs on port `5001`
   - Uses a built image (static code) to verify exact production behavior before going live.
   - Recommended URL: `test.evaitec.com.tr`

3. **Production (`prod`)**:
   - Runs on port `5000`
   - Fully optimized built image for the live site.
   - Recommended URL: `evaitec.com.tr` or `www.evaitec.com.tr`

